			"widgets_values":[
				"[4koma] In this whimsical and lighthearted sequence, \n\n[SCENE-1] <A young boy>, around 7 years old with messy brown hair and a bright yellow T-shirt, stands at the entrance of a colorful amusement park. His eyes are wide with excitement as he clutches a red balloon in one hand and a map of the park in the other. Behind him, the towering Ferris wheel and a roller coaster loop dominate the background, while cheerful crowds bustle around. The boy’s expression is a mix of awe and determination as he plans his adventure.\n\n[SCENE-2] The boy is now in front of a cotton candy stand, his face lit up with delight as he holds a giant swirl of pink and blue cotton candy almost as big as his head. The vendor, a cheerful man in a striped hat, smiles warmly as he hands over the treat. In the background, a carousel spins with children riding on colorful horses, and the sound of laughter fills the air.\n\n[SCENE-3] The boy is on a small roller coaster, gripping the safety bar tightly with both hands. His face is a hilarious mix of terror and exhilaration as the ride dips down a steep slope. His red balloon, tied to his wrist, flutters wildly in the wind. Behind him, other kids are screaming with joy, and the bright blue sky is dotted with fluffy white clouds.\n\n[SCENE-4] The boy sits on a bench near the park’s exit, his hair slightly messy from all the rides. He’s happily munching on a cone of rainbow-colored ice cream, his cheeks smudged with a bit of melted sweetness. The red balloon is now tied to the bench, gently swaying in the breeze. In the background, the Ferris wheel lights up as the sun begins to set, casting a golden glow over the park. The boy looks content and tired, a perfect end to his fun-filled day."
